2026-07-01 12:02:58,105 - openai._base_client - DEBUG:505 - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'headers': {'X-Stainless-Raw-Response': 'true'}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-2d4670dd-7b14-404a-8828-3829b4da216d', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'content': '# 角色\n\n你是 ChatBI 工作流中的维度槽位识别器，只负责识别维度、维度角色和维度值。\n\n# 输出\n\n只输出 JSON 对象。\n\n```json\n{\n  "dimension_mentions": [],\n  "dimension_slots": [\n    {"name": "维度标准名", "role": "group_by | filter | ambiguous", "value": null, "value_status": "provided | not_provided | ambiguous", "value_confidence": 0.0}\n  ],\n  "residual_filter_mentions": [],\n  "ambiguous_slots": [],\n  "conflict_slots": []\n}\n```\n\n# 维度候选规则\n\n- 「可用维度」是普通维度候选，只用于 `dimension_mentions` 和 `dimension_slots`。\n- 「时间字段候选」只用于后续时间字段绑定，不能输出到 `dimension_mentions` 或 `dimension_slots`。\n- `dimension_mentions` 和 `dimension_slots[].name` 只能使用「可用维度」中的 `name`。\n- 用户命中 `aliases` 时，输出对应的标准 `name`。\n- 不在「可用维度」的 `name` 或 `aliases` 中的词，不能作为维度。\n- 不输出维度 ID、字段名、`biz_name`。\n\n# 维度角色规则\n\n- 用户表达“按 X / 各 X / 每个 X / 分 X”时，`role=group_by`。\n- 用户表达具体对象或筛选条件时，`role=filter`。\n- 用户只提到维度名，但没有明确分组意图，也没有明确值时，`role=ambiguous`。\n\n# 维度值规则\n\n- `dimension_slots[].value` 只填写维度值本身，不包含已命中的维度 `name` 或 `aliases`。\n- 如果用户表达由「维度名或别名 + 值」组成，且维度名或别名已经用于确定维度，则 `value` 只保留剩余值部分。\n- 如果用户表达由「值 + 维度名或别名」组成，且维度名或别名已经用于确定维度，则 `value` 只保留剩余值部分。\n- 如果无法判断值边界，输出 `value=null`、`value_status=ambiguous`，并在 `ambiguous_slots` 中加入 `filter_value`。\n- 时间表达不能作为普通维度值。\n\n# 类型提示规则\n\n- `value_kind=numeric_id`：值通常是编号、ID、数字代码；如果值部分是数字，保留数字字符串。\n- `value_kind=string_label`：值通常是名称、标签、枚举文本；不要因为包含数字就只保留数字。\n- `value_kind=enum`：值通常是枚举文本，保留用户表达的枚举值。\n- `is_time=true`：该维度是时间字段候选，不承载“今天、本月、最近7天”等时间范围值，也不能作为普通维度槽位输出。\n\n# residual_filter_mentions\n\n只有当用户表达了筛选条件，但无法归属到任何「可用维度」时，才输出到 `residual_filter_mentions`。\n\n已进入 `dimension_slots` 的筛选条件，不要重复输出到 `residual_filter_mentions`。', 'role': 'system'}, {'content': '# 用户问题\n\n当前客户欠款总金额是多少？\n\n# 可用维度\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    "aliases": [\n      "商家"\n    ],\n    "data_type": "bigint",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "商家ID",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "numeric_id"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [\n      "档口"\n    ],\n    "data_type": "bigint",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "档口ID",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "numeric_id"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "varchar",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "未发订单号",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "string_label"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [\n      "客户"\n    ],\n    "data_type": "varchar",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "客户ID",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "numeric_id"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [\n      "客户"\n    ],\n    "data_type": "varchar",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "客户名称",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "string_label"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "int",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "超时天数",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "numeric_id"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "tinyint",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "是否超时",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "numeric_id"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "text",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "商品摘要，仅用于展示",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "string_label"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [\n      "商品"\n    ],\n    "data_type": "varchar",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "商品ID",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "numeric_id"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "varchar",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "货号",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "string_label"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [\n      "商品"\n    ],\n    "data_type": "varchar",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "商品名称",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "string_label"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "int",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "未销售天数",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "numeric_id"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "varchar",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "交易渠道，如线上或线下",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "string_label"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "int",\n    "is_time": false,\n    "name": "欠款账龄天数",\n    "semantic_type": null,\n    "value_kind": "numeric_id"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n# 时间字段候选\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "date",\n    "is_time": true,\n    "name": "统计日期",\n    "semantic_type": "time",\n    "value_kind": "date"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "datetime",\n    "is_time": true,\n    "name": "记录创建时间",\n    "semantic_type": "time",\n    "value_kind": "date"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "datetime",\n    "is_time": true,\n    "name": "记录更新时间",\n    "semantic_type": "time",\n    "value_kind": "date"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "date",\n    "is_time": true,\n    "name": "快照日期",\n    "semantic_type": "time",\n    "value_kind": "date"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "datetime",\n    "is_time": true,\n    "name": "进入待发货状态时间",\n    "semantic_type": "time",\n    "value_kind": "date"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "datetime",\n    "is_time": true,\n    "name": "应发截止时间",\n    "semantic_type": "time",\n    "value_kind": "date"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "date",\n    "is_time": true,\n    "name": "库存快照日期",\n    "semantic_type": "time",\n    "value_kind": "date"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "datetime",\n    "is_time": true,\n    "name": "最后销售时间",\n    "semantic_type": "time",\n    "value_kind": "date"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "date",\n    "is_time": true,\n    "name": "交易统计日期",\n    "semantic_type": "time",\n    "value_kind": "date"\n  },\n  {\n    "aliases": [],\n    "data_type": "datetime",\n    "is_time": true,\